{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/115757","id":3236440511,"node_id":"PR_kwDOAO6SJc7A6Cm_","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/115757","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/115757.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/115757.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/115757","commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/115757/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/115757/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/115757/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/statuses/482d9313a2626950356c8ad8e12d7cbbb4c081c3","number":115757,"state":"closed","locked":false,"title":"Fix accidental write-combined memory reads in canvas renderer.","user":{"login":"blueskythlikesclouds","id":19259897,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5MjU5ODk3","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19259897?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/blueskythlikesclouds","html_url":"https://github.com/blueskythlikesclouds","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/blueskythlikesclouds/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/blueskythlikesclouds/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/blueskythlikesclouds/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/blueskythlikesclouds/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/blueskythlikesclouds/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/blueskythlikesclouds/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/blueskythlikesclouds/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/blueskythlikesclouds/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/blueskythlikesclouds/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"Fixes #115431.\r\n\r\n`new_instance_data` returns an `InstanceData` pointer for the caller to populate. After #111183, the pointer lives in the memory region returned by the buffer mapping function. \r\n\r\nOn UMA systems, this is fine. However, on discrete GPUs, reading from these memory regions has a significant performance cost because the memory is write-combined.\r\n\r\nAccumulating instance flags using the `|=` operator is affected by this, as it requires reading the existing flags from memory before applying the OR operation.\r\n\r\nRather than fixing each location where the flags are accumulated, I changed the function to return an intermediary instance data pointer instead. This should prevent future contributors from running into the same issue.\r\n\r\nWith this, the CPU performance returns back to how it was in 4.5.1.","labels":[{"id":73330064,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2NA==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/bug","name":"bug","description":"","color":"ff6055","default":true,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279098111,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTgxMTE=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:rendering","name":"topic:rendering","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":1332303119,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwxMzMyMzAzMTE5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/regression","name":"regression","description":"","color":"ff63ac","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":3240950060,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwzMjQwOTUwMDYw","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/performance","name":"performance","description":"","color":"447777","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"milestone":{"id":14236899,"node_id":"MI_kwDOAO6SJc4A2Tzj","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/24","html